代，不補成員姓名及支系。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan","book_id":"b-shiji-051","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-051-jingyan"},{"id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:p005","text":"高祖十一年秋，淮南王黥布反，東擊荊。荊王賈與戰，不勝，走富陵，為布軍所殺。高祖自擊破布。十二年，立沛侯劉濞為吳王，王故荊地。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:m005-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003196","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:m005-0007","start":7,"end":12,"surface":"淮南王黥布","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003186","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:m005-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"荊王賈","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003189","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:m005-0032","start":32,"end":33,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003186","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:m005-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003196","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:m005-0042","start":42,"end":43,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003186","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:m005-0049","start":49,"end":53,"surface":"沛侯劉濞","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003190","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan","book_id":"b-shiji-051","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-051-jingyan"},{"id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:p006","text":"燕王劉澤者，諸劉遠屬也。高帝三年，澤為郎中。高帝十一年，澤以將軍擊陳豨，得王黃，為營陵侯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:m006-0000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"燕王劉澤","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003188","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:m006-0006","start":6,"end":10,"surface":"諸劉遠屬","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名家屬、條件稱號或未定指代，不補成員姓名及支系。"},{"id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:m006-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003196","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:m006-0017","start":17,"end":18,"surface":"澤","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003188","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:m006-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003196","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:m006-0028","start":28,"end":29,"surface":"澤","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003188","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:m006-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"陳豨","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003202","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:m006-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"王黃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003203","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan","book_id":"b-shiji-051","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-051-jingyan"},{"id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:p007","text":"高后時，齊人田生游乏資，以畫干營陵侯澤。澤大說之，用金二百斤為田生壽。田生已得金，即歸齊。二年，澤使人謂田生曰：「弗與矣。」田生如長安，不見澤，而假大宅，令其子求事呂后所幸大謁者張子卿。居數月，田生子請張卿臨，親修具。張卿許往。田生盛帷帳共具，譬如列侯。張卿驚。酒酣，乃屏人說張卿曰：「臣觀諸侯王邸弟百餘，皆高祖一切功臣。今呂氏雅故本推轂高帝就天下，功至大，又親戚太后之重。太后春秋長，諸呂弱，太后欲立呂產為［呂］王，王代。太后又重發之，恐大臣不聽。今卿最幸，大臣所敬，何不風大臣以聞太后，太后必喜。諸呂已王，萬戶侯亦卿之有。太后心欲之，而卿為內臣，不急發，恐禍及身矣。」張卿大然之，乃風大臣語太后。太后朝，因問大臣。大臣請立呂產為呂王。太后賜張卿千斤金，張卿以其半與田生。田生弗受，因說之曰：「呂產王也，諸大臣未大服。今營陵侯澤，諸劉，為大將軍，獨此尚觖望。今卿言太后，列十餘縣王之，彼得王，喜去，諸呂王益固矣。」張卿入言，太后然之。乃以營陵侯劉澤為瑯邪王。瑯邪王乃與田生之國。田生勸澤急行，毋留。出關，太后果使人追止之，已出，即還。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:m007-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"高后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003204","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:m007-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"田生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003205","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:m007-0015","start":15,"end":19,"surface":"營陵侯澤","kind":"person","p